$ rtok memory --help
Notes (`mem_save` / import / export)

Usage: rtok memory [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  import  Import `{kind,title,body}` JSONL; dedupe by body sha256
  export  Print every note but session checkpoints as the JSONL `import` reads
  retire  Retire a note: a tombstone — never recalled or searched, body kept
  pin     Pin a note so it leads SessionStart recall
  unpin   Drop a note back to newest-first recall order
  revise  Save a replacement (title, body) for a note and retire the old row
  sync    Write pinned-then-newest titles into a managed CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md block
  status  Notes live/pinned/retired, recall and MCP call counts
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
