$ rtok graph --help
Symbol index (`rtok graph index`)

Usage: rtok graph [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  index     Walk a tree and insert definitions + references
  dead      List unreferenced private definitions (skips pub, trait impls, tests, macros)
  status    Index health for the current or given root
  impact    Symbol impact or call paths to a target
  projects  The project registry: list, add, remove, select
  affected  Tests that reach files changed in git (`git diff --name-only`)
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
  -h, --help           Print help

$ rtok graph index --help
Walk a tree and insert definitions + references

Usage: rtok graph index [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  

Options:
      --config <PATH>  User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --dry-run        Report what would be indexed and write no rows
  -h, --help           Print help

$ rtok graph dead --help
List unreferenced private definitions (skips pub, trait impls, tests, macros)

