Commands:
  start    Detach a supervisor that restarts the service whenever it dies
  stop     Ask the supervisor and its child to exit
  restart  Stop, then start
  status   State, pids, uptime, restarts and log path; every service when none is named
  kill     SIGKILL instead of SIGTERM, and drop the state file
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
  -h, --help           Print help

