$ rtok report --help
The operator model as one document: Markdown, HTML and PDF

Usage: rtok report [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>    User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format [default: md] [possible values: md, html, pdf]
      --out <PATH>       Write to this path instead of stdout
      --since <SINCE>    How far back the report reads (`30d`, `24h`)
